          "english": "It is important that scientists be seen as normal people asking and answering important questions. Good, sound science depends on __(26)__ , experiments and reasoned methodologies. It requires a willingness to ask new questions and try new approaches. It requires one to take risks and experience failures. But good science also requires __(27)__ understanding, clear explanation and concise presentation.",
